{"id":"n61070-2-7","stage":5,"title":"붙들리다 · 被抓住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61070-2-7-1","ko":"승규는 이제 가출은 안 한대?","zh":"承奎说现在不会再离家出走了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가출은","meaning":"离家出走","explanation":"가출：离家出走；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가출","audio":"/audio/e5a9c6beabb8d9fd6cb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14224","senseId":"1","lemma":"가출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한대?","meaning":"做（가출을 하다：离家出走）","explanation":"하다：做（가출을 하다：离家出走）；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"e5a9c6beabb8d9fd","term":"가출","zh":"离家出走","audio":"/audio/e5a9c6beabb8d9fd6cb4.mp3","entryId":"14224","definition":"抛弃家庭，走出家门不回来。","pronunciation":["가출"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（가출을 하다：离家出走）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（가출을 하다：离家出走）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b6cc0bba7f5a607562c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61070-2-7-2","ko":"응, 부모님에게 붙들려서 집에서 나올 수가 없나 봐.","zh":"嗯，好像被父母拦住了，没法再离开家吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님에게","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙들려서","meaning":"被抓住，被逮住","explanation":"붙들리다：被抓住，被逮住；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"붙들리다","audio":"/audio/2b8e91c7a03121acc51d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61070","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나올","meaning":"出，走出","explanation":"나오다：出，走出；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"13","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없나","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"2b8e91c7a03121ac","term":"붙들리다","zh":"被抓住，被逮住","audio":"/audio/2b8e91c7a03121acc51d.mp3","entryId":"61070","definition":"被捉住而无法逃脱。","pronunciation":["붇뜰리다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，走出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"脱离某处。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b78ff83dd0d17ce53af6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61070","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，好像被父母拦住了，没法再离开家吧。","承奎说现在不会再离家出走了吗？","你怎么能对初次见面的人也这么大方自然？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎说现在不会再离家出走了吗？","你怎么能对初次见面的人也这么大方自然？","嗯，好像被父